Id: nfs004f
Severity: FAIL
Category: network
Check: check_exports
Fix: Stop exporting / read-write to everyone; name the clients and export read-only.
References: exports(5)
Controls: CIS 3.3, 4.8; NIST AC-3, CM-7; ISO 8.3, 8.21; CE Secure configuration

Exporting the root file system allows remote machines to
access critical file such as /etc/passwd.  Exporting this
R/W to everyone means that on the Internet can modify system
files, allowing them to gain further access to the machine.
